# BCSV Flutter Church App - Project Structure Guide

## Overview
This is a Flutter mobile application for Bridgeway Baptist Church (BCSV) with Korean/English localization support.

## Entry Point
- [main.dart](mdc:lib/main.dart) - App entry point, sets up themes, localization, and navigation
- [home_screen.dart](mdc:lib/screens/home_screen.dart) - Main dashboard with feature cards

## Directory Structure

### Core Directories
- `lib/screens/` - All screen widgets and UI pages
- `lib/components/` - Reusable UI components (cards, icons, etc.)
- `lib/services/` - Business logic, API calls, background services
- `lib/utilities/` - App utilities (themes, constants, shared preferences)
- `lib/l10n/` - Internationalization files (Korean/English)
- `lib/data_models/` - Data models and structures
- `lib/dialog/` - Dialog components

### Assets & Resources
- `assets/images/` - App images and icons
- `fonts/` - Custom fonts (Korean fonts like Dongle, Sunflower)
- `android/` - Android platform-specific code and resources
- `ios/` - iOS platform-specific code and resources

## Key Configuration Files
- [pubspec.yaml](mdc:pubspec.yaml) - Dependencies and asset declarations
- [l10n.yaml](mdc:l10n.yaml) - Localization configuration
- [analysis_options.yaml](mdc:analysis_options.yaml) - Dart/Flutter linting rules

## Architecture Patterns
- **State Management**: Provider pattern with ThemeNotifier and LocaleProvider
- **Navigation**: MaterialPageRoute with standard Navigator
- **Networking**: HTTP with timeout handling and background services
- **Storage**: SharedPreferences for user settings and cache
- **Internationalization**: flutter_localizations with Korean/English support
- **Theming**: Dynamic theme switching with user preferences
